        description: "G\u1EEDi g\xF3i tin Ping-Broker \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111o th\u1EDDi gian ph\u1EA3n h\u1ED3i v\xE0 ki\u1EC3m tra l\u1ED7i x\xE1c th\u1EF1c t\u1EEB Broker.",
