        message: `T\xE0i kho\u1EA3n '${context.userEmail}' (vai tr\xF2: ${context.userRole}) kh\xF4ng c\xF3 quy\u1EC1n '${tool.requiredPermission}' \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EF1c thi c\xF4ng c\u1EE5 '${toolName}'.`
